{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"deuteranopia-safe","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Deuteranopia Safe","description":"Blues, oranges and yellows only, so no information depends on telling red from green.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Themes"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"themes":[{"label":"Deuteranopia Safe","path":"themes/deuteranopia-safe.json","uiTheme":"dark"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"themes/deuteranopia-safe.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"name\": \"Deuteranopia Safe\",\n  \"type\": \"dark\",\n  \"colors\": {\n    \"editor.background\": \"#14181f\",\n    \"editor.foreground\": \"#e3e8ef\",\n    \"sideBar.background\": \"#10141a\",\n    \"activityBar.background\": \"#0c1015\",\n    \"titleBar.activeBackground\": \"#0c1015\",\n    \"tab.inactiveBackground\": \"#10141a\",\n    \"list.hoverBackground\": \"#1f2630\",\n    \"list.activeSelectionBackground\": \"#2b4c7e\",\n    \"input.background\": \"#1f2630\",\n    \"editorWidget.background\": \"#10141a\",\n    \"panel.border\": \"#0c1015\",\n    \"focusBorder\": \"#56b4e9\",\n    \"button.background\": \"#56b4e9\",\n    \"textLink.foreground\": \"#56b4e9\",\n    \"editor.selectionBackground\": \"#2b4c7e\",\n    \"editor.lineHighlightBackground\": \"#1f263080\",\n    \"editorCursor.foreground\": \"#56b4e9\",\n    \"editorIndentGuide.background\": \"#0c1015\",\n    \"errorForeground\": \"#e69f00\",\n    \"gitDecoration.addedResourceForeground\": \"#56b4e9\",\n    \"gitDecoration.modifiedResourceForeground\": \"#f0e442\",\n    \"gitDecoration.deletedResourceForeground\": \"#e69f00\"\n  },\n  \"tokenColors\": [\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"comment\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#7c8798\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"string\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#f0e442\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.numeric\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#e69f00\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"keyword\",\n        \"storage\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#56b4e9\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.type\",\n        \"support.type\",\n        \"storage.type\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#cc79a7\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function\",\n        \"support.function\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#f0e442\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.language\",\n        \"constant\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#e69f00\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"variable.other.property\",\n        \"support.type.property-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#9ccae8\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.tag\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#56b4e9\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.other.attribute-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#e69f00\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function.macro\",\n        \"meta.preprocessor\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#cc79a7\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Deuteranopia Safe\n\nBlues, oranges and yellows only, so no information depends on telling red from green.\n\nInstall it, then pick **Deuteranopia Safe** in **Settings > Colour theme**. It is a dark theme.\n\nAn original palette by Vyloxi. Colors picked to stay distinct for red-green color blindness.\n\n| Role | Color |\n| --- | --- |\n| Background | `#14181f` |\n| Text | `#e3e8ef` |\n| Accent | `#56b4e9` |\n| Keywords | `#56b4e9` |\n| Strings | `#f0e442` |\n| Functions | `#f0e442` |\n| Types | `#cc79a7` |\n| Comments | `#7c8798` |\n\nThis extension is only a theme: it runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}